              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namoonni qubata Daaniitti lakkaaʼaman hundis 157,600 turan. Isaanis dhuma irratti faajjii isaanii jalaan haa deeman.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
